{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>In this game\u00a0Strategy is the key to\u00a0Survival.</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>You need a awesome Grand Strategy to win this war,</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>A RTS action game with an Cool Base Building feature.</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your base to helping you to fight a war against Armies of Zombies, Aliens and a Plant-based intelligence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Normal RTS like CNC, you just need a simple\u00a0Strategy, but this game has another layer to it,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You need to make plans for a\u00a0Grand Strategy, setting this\u00a0Single player RTS apart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You might win one battle, but the enemies can attack another spot, just like in a real war of Survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>These are the units under your command.</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1016100/extras/4873bd138e6addb72525f327d83596c9.avif?t=1775929410\" width=500 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use Base Building to protect your army, as you plan your next raid into the enemy area.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the fighting begins, and your army rolls into Action, You alone have the Strategy to win.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>The Enemies:</u></strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zombies just attack, with no real Strategy. Their Base Building is simple, with little defenses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Plants, also lacks any\u00a0Strategy, but they are good at Base Building, and hard to kill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Aliens have a Grand Strategy, and advanced base building, with strong Defenses..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>The map:</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This RTS war game, has 30 maps; Some give you new weapons, others more money.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The wrong Strategy will get you fighting in some lost desert, will the Zombies and Aliens kill of the large cities... draining you for money.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1016100/extras/c990a50317e13fa01537cde2142ea89c.avif?t=1775929410\" width=580 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game was build looking at Command and Conquer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But where CnC is build on straight forward battle, where if you win one battle, you get to the next stage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is more like real world strategy, where one battle won, might mean the enemy got in behind your forces, and took a high value land from you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think Risk, but with CNC battle's.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"5a8fdc7ff9c3044a95204caf402152406fa4cb08.jpg","localized_name":"Start The Game","name":"Start The Game","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1016100/5a8fdc7ff9c3044a95204caf402152406fa4cb08.jpg"},{"icon":"ba89decd3093964b12eaab87b59eb0c4b6a9aaf4.jpg","localized_name":"Win Your First Battle","name":"Win Your First Battle","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1016100/ba89decd3093964b12eaab87b59eb0c4b6a9aaf4.jpg"},{"icon":"72de4c3ae93c7cc259dc500141359ce49de78207.jpg","localized_name":"First Zombie Battle","name":"First Zombie Battle","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1016100/72de4c3ae93c7cc259dc500141359ce49de78207.jpg"},{"icon":"4742425490de55d9d700a32889da