e Strategy to win.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>The Enemies:</u></strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zombies just attack, with no real Strategy. Their Base Building is simple, with little defenses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Plants, also lacks any\u00a0Strategy, but they are good at Base Building, and hard to kill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Aliens have a Grand Strategy, and advanced base building, with strong Defenses..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>The map:</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This RTS war game, has 30 maps; Some give you new weapons, others more money.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The wrong Strategy will get you fighting in some lost desert, will the Zombies and Aliens kill of the large cities... draining you for money.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1016100/extras/c990a50317e13fa01537cde2142ea89c.avif?t=1775929410\" width=580 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game was build looking at Command and Conquer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But where CnC is build on straight forward battle, where if you win one battle, you get to the next stage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is more like real world strategy, where one battle won, might mean the enemy got in behind your forces, and took a high value land from you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think Risk, but with CNC battle's.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["J. C. SpringBourne"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1016100/header.jpg?t=1775929410","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1